{"projectInfo":{"name":"OSPF虚连接配置举例（交换）","path":"ospfxulianjie","visibility":2,"categoryId":6280,"introduction":"Area 2与Area 0没有直接相连。Area 1被用作传输区域（Transit Area）来连接Area 2和Area 0。SWB和SW C之间配置一条虚连接。配置完成后，SWB能够学到Area 2中的路由。。","label":["OSPF","虚连接"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWD","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWD.cfg"}]}